[00:01.58]1. Ever onward, O my people,
[00:04.64]Let the Kingdom tidings go.
[00:08.34]Tremble not before our foe.
[00:12.08]Let all lovers of truth know
[00:15.66]That my reigning Son, Christ Jesus,
[00:19.20]To the earth has cast the foe,
[00:22.78]Soon to bind the Devil, Satan,
[00:26.66]Letting all his victims go.
[00:29.68](Chorus)
[00:29.68]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[00:29.68]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[00:46.68]I will keep my faithful servant
[00:52.68]As the apple of my eye.
[01:01.46]2. Even though your foes are many,
[01:06.40]Though they threaten and revile,
[01:10.32]Though they flatter and they smile,
[01:14.08]To mislead and to beguile.
[01:18.42]Fear them not, my faithful people,
[01:21.84]Nor their persecution’s heat,
[01:25.00]For I will preserve the faithful
[01:28.64]Till the vict’ry is complete.
[01:34.40](Chorus)
[01:34.62]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[01:41.26]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[01:48.92]I will keep my faithful servant
[01:55.06]As the apple of my eye.
[02:01.58]3. Never fear you are forgotten;
[02:04.18]I am still your strength and shield.
[02:08.16]Though you die upon the field,
[02:12.28]Even death to me will yield.
[02:16.30]Fear them not who kill the body
[02:19.48]But cannot destroy the soul.
[02:23.00]To the end may you be faithful;
[02:26.34]I will bring you to your goal!
[02:32.20](Chorus)
[02:32.46]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[02:39.80]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[02:46.82]I will keep my faithful servant
[02:52.92]As the apple of my eye.
